# Local Windows workaround: NTFS forbids "*" in filenames, so the upstream
# file Countries----...-(cores-*-months)-...csv cannot be checked out here.
# A hand-renamed "_" copy is kept locally but must not be committed, or it
# would duplicate the upstream file on every other platform.
*(cores-_-months)*
